# Postfix virtual aliases — source of truth: deploy/postfix/virtual.
# Applied with postmap by ./deploy/postfix/apply.py --apply.
#
# Bounce mailbox: every VERP sender and every unmatched address under
# mail.odile.fyi lands here. scripts/mail_dsn.py reads the Maildir and
# ignores anything that is not a delivery report (DMARC aggregate reports
# arrive here too, by design).
@mail.odile.fyi      dsn

# Human mailbox: replies to an invite, and anything sent to the apex.
help@odile.fyi       help
help@mail.odile.fyi  help
invite@mail.odile.fyi help
